WEBVTT

00:00:04.430 --> 00:00:09.230
I love being human!

00:00:12.340 --> 00:00:13.070
"Infinite Light of Explosive Love"

00:00:27.460 --> 00:00:29.860
Tsugumi! Be strong.

00:00:34.530 --> 00:00:42.230
<i>Go tight, in an unidentified show time.</i>

00:00:54.380 --> 00:00:59.050
<i>Against a backlit hill,</i>
<i>I profess the origins of love.</i>

00:00:59.050 --> 00:01:02.060
<i>For the sake of you and me</i>

00:01:02.060 --> 00:01:04.050
<i>Shake it down, Shake it down</i>

00:01:05.390 --> 00:01:13.400
<i>After a millennium of loneliness,</i>
<i>I happened upon your bewitching gaze.</i>

00:01:13.400 --> 00:01:14.740
<i>Shake it down, Shake it down</i>

00:01:14.740 --> 00:01:19.070
<i>I want to be connected!</i>

00:01:19.070 --> 00:01:24.410
<i>What a restless feeling this is!</i>

00:01:24.410 --> 00:01:29.750
<i>It's like being born out of</i> <i>a foaming sea, this energy!</i>

00:01:29.750 --> 00:01:36.090
<i>We're gonna go tight,</i> <i>in an unidentified show time.</i>

00:01:36.090 --> 00:01:38.760
<i>Moved to tears,</i> <i>this is definitely not a dream,</i>

00:01:38.760 --> 00:01:41.100
<i>it's a dash for love.</i>

00:01:41.100 --> 00:01:44.100
<i>Our hearts are all that are here,</i>

00:01:44.100 --> 00:01:46.770
<i>our hopes in an endless black hole.</i>

00:01:46.770 --> 00:01:52.800
<i>I want us to be one, forever.</i>

00:02:07.060 --> 00:02:09.460
Military Vectors...

00:02:09.460 --> 00:02:13.020
How dirty! They used us?

00:02:17.270 --> 00:02:21.430
Damn! If they get there first,
Silvia and the others will be...

00:02:24.770 --> 00:02:26.340
What the-

00:02:26.340 --> 00:02:28.340
Tsugumi!

00:02:28.340 --> 00:02:30.080
Tsugumi out, Pierre in!

00:02:30.080 --> 00:02:31.910
Roger!

00:02:34.150 --> 00:02:38.220
I'll cure you, I swear!

00:02:38.220 --> 00:02:39.710
Transport!

00:02:51.200 --> 00:02:53.530
--Let's do it!
--Right!

00:03:12.550 --> 00:03:16.290
Commence Operation Blackout.

00:03:16.290 --> 00:03:19.020
Roger.

00:03:51.590 --> 00:03:53.330
How many Gattai-capable
Vectors are left?

00:03:53.330 --> 00:03:54.660
Nine.

00:03:54.660 --> 00:03:57.790
All Vectors, assume
Armageddon Formation.

00:04:11.210 --> 00:04:12.810
What are those things?

00:04:16.120 --> 00:04:20.390
Target twelve o'clock position!
PSG cannons at maximum!

00:04:20.390 --> 00:04:22.290
Roger.

00:04:31.830 --> 00:04:33.560
Fire!

00:04:48.980 --> 00:04:50.710
What?!

00:04:55.190 --> 00:04:58.320
--They're coming!
--Cursed wingless ones!

00:05:09.100 --> 00:05:13.200
No one gets beyond this point!

00:05:16.080 --> 00:05:18.980
Change! Omega!

00:05:18.980 --> 00:05:21.070
Child's play!

00:05:25.320 --> 00:05:27.050
Glen!

00:05:29.220 --> 00:05:31.420
Puny nothings!

00:05:36.030 --> 00:05:40.940
Glen!

00:05:40.940 --> 00:05:43.600
Reika...

00:05:45.370 --> 00:05:47.240
Glen...

00:05:49.780 --> 00:05:51.150
Reika!

00:05:51.150 --> 00:05:53.480
Die!

00:05:57.850 --> 00:05:58.990
Reika!

00:05:58.990 --> 00:06:03.020
Glen! Thank goodness!
You're back to yourself!

00:06:03.020 --> 00:06:06.390
Yes. Sorry I made you worry.

00:06:06.390 --> 00:06:08.630
Impudence!

00:06:11.170 --> 00:06:12.300
Glen!

00:06:12.300 --> 00:06:14.070
Go on ahead, Reika!

00:06:14.070 --> 00:06:15.740
I can't leave you!

00:06:15.740 --> 00:06:17.340
You have to, Reika!

00:06:17.340 --> 00:06:19.640
But I can't leave you behind alone!

00:06:19.640 --> 00:06:21.580
This is no time for that!

00:06:21.580 --> 00:06:22.880
But...

00:06:22.880 --> 00:06:25.870
The future of humanity is at stake!

00:06:28.180 --> 00:06:29.780
Roger!

00:06:30.720 --> 00:06:33.620
Bring it on!

00:06:33.620 --> 00:06:35.720
What?!

00:06:40.260 --> 00:06:42.400
Glen...

00:06:42.400 --> 00:06:45.070
Apollo! Pierre! Let's go!

00:06:45.070 --> 00:06:47.170
Okay! Let's do it!

00:06:48.600 --> 00:06:53.880
When Solar Wing returns to Heaven...

00:06:53.880 --> 00:06:57.610
...the world will come to an end.

00:06:57.610 --> 00:07:00.420
Can they win?

00:07:00.420 --> 00:07:02.980
Win?

00:07:02.980 --> 00:07:06.050
Can they destroy the Shadow Angels?

00:07:09.760 --> 00:07:12.330
What is this place?

00:07:12.330 --> 00:07:13.830
Those are human beings!

00:07:13.830 --> 00:07:17.800
They're the people snatched by the Harvest Beasts for their Prana!

00:07:17.800 --> 00:07:19.030
What?!

00:07:19.030 --> 00:07:26.700
Then... could all the people who were snatched away be planted here?

00:07:28.240 --> 00:07:32.310
Shadow Angels use humans as offerings.

00:07:32.310 --> 00:07:36.850
If humankind dies out, so too will the Shadow Angels.

00:07:36.850 --> 00:07:39.390
That is the Shadow Angels' destiny.

00:07:39.390 --> 00:07:42.520
Humans have no free will?!

00:07:42.520 --> 00:07:43.890
Correct.

00:07:43.890 --> 00:07:51.030
Humans will not die, but they will lose their will- their freedom.

00:07:51.030 --> 00:07:52.130
Dammit!

00:07:52.130 --> 00:07:53.900
Let's take out their leader quickly,

00:07:53.900 --> 00:07:55.770
so we can rescue
Silvia and the others!

00:07:55.770 --> 00:07:57.400
Let's go!

00:08:06.180 --> 00:08:08.020
It's huge!

00:08:08.020 --> 00:08:11.690
Is this the legendary Tree of Life?

00:08:11.690 --> 00:08:13.550
What's this smell?

00:08:13.550 --> 00:08:14.460
Is it the enemy?

00:08:14.460 --> 00:08:17.590
No. Something much greater.

00:08:17.590 --> 00:08:19.990
I smell immense power.

00:08:19.990 --> 00:08:22.130
Power?

00:08:22.130 --> 00:08:25.170
What is it that's above us?!

00:08:25.170 --> 00:08:27.640
If they topple the Tree of Life,

00:08:27.640 --> 00:08:34.880
the Earth's energy bound by its roots will burst forth all at once.

00:08:34.880 --> 00:08:40.680
If that should happen, this will be a lifeless planet for all eternity.

00:08:40.680 --> 00:08:43.250
Is that possible?!

00:08:43.250 --> 00:08:45.750
You're not getting away!

00:08:45.750 --> 00:08:47.860
Child's play!

00:08:47.860 --> 00:08:49.920
What?!

00:08:51.960 --> 00:08:54.720
Is that the best you can do?!

00:09:03.700 --> 00:09:08.870
You are, after all, a wingless one...
Nothing to it.

00:09:12.080 --> 00:09:16.480
I cannot... let you...

00:09:16.480 --> 00:09:20.090
let you...

00:09:20.090 --> 00:09:22.750
...go!

00:09:25.390 --> 00:09:27.860
What is this power?!

00:09:38.740 --> 00:09:41.640
You and your kind...

00:09:48.220 --> 00:09:50.620
Glen... Glen!

00:09:54.720 --> 00:09:57.160
Glen!

00:09:59.330 --> 00:10:03.200
How is it that you know so much?

00:10:03.200 --> 00:10:06.630
12,000 years ago, Aquarion sealed away the Shadow Angels...

00:10:06.630 --> 00:10:09.840
The Elements at that time were
Apollonius, Seliane, and...

00:10:09.840 --> 00:10:13.440
...a third Element whose name was erased from the Book of Genesis.

00:10:13.440 --> 00:10:15.770
Was it you?!

00:10:21.620 --> 00:10:23.280
Apollonius!

00:10:23.280 --> 00:10:25.010
Seliane!

00:10:36.460 --> 00:10:39.730
What is this place?

00:10:39.730 --> 00:10:41.470
Brother!

00:10:41.470 --> 00:10:43.400
Silvia.

00:10:47.510 --> 00:10:49.530
Brother!

00:10:54.150 --> 00:10:59.850
Brother... Brother... don't tell me this place is...

00:10:59.850 --> 00:11:02.760
Yes. This is Atlandia.

00:11:02.760 --> 00:11:06.460
It can't be!
Atlandia is the Shadow Angels'...

00:11:06.460 --> 00:11:10.430
Not Shadow Angels.
They're Angels, Silvia.

00:11:10.430 --> 00:11:13.930
This is their lovely capital.

00:11:13.930 --> 00:11:16.240
But...

00:11:16.240 --> 00:11:20.010
You recalled your past life as Seliane.

00:11:20.010 --> 00:11:24.110
But I still cannot remember mine...

00:11:24.110 --> 00:11:26.810
But it is inside my heart....

00:11:26.810 --> 00:11:31.720
The sadness from long, long ago...

00:11:31.720 --> 00:11:34.390
That's why I brought you here.

00:11:34.390 --> 00:11:38.260
I don't ever want to experience that sadness again.

00:11:42.030 --> 00:11:44.190
But...

00:11:46.370 --> 00:11:47.970
You are still unsure...

00:11:47.970 --> 00:11:49.960
I will put an end to that!

00:11:53.010 --> 00:11:57.380
Watch from there as we put an end to the wingless ones!

00:12:16.800 --> 00:12:18.570
Unbelievable...

00:12:18.570 --> 00:12:24.340
The Tree of Life... just as I saw it in my dream...

00:12:24.340 --> 00:12:27.210
It's become so huge...

00:12:27.210 --> 00:12:29.940
If it keeps growing, the world will be...

00:12:43.190 --> 00:12:45.160
Vector Sol!

00:12:45.160 --> 00:12:46.890
Apollo?!

00:12:46.890 --> 00:12:49.130
Apollo, is that you?!

00:12:49.130 --> 00:12:50.330
This scent...

00:12:50.330 --> 00:12:51.820
Silvia!

00:12:56.340 --> 00:12:58.400
Sirius!

00:13:02.180 --> 00:13:05.200
What took you, Apollo?

00:13:06.710 --> 00:13:10.240
Angel Gattai! Cherubim Mars!

00:13:16.690 --> 00:13:19.890
Trouble! Sirius has Merged with the Cherubim again!

00:13:19.890 --> 00:13:23.730
Reika! This time, don't let go of his hand!

00:13:23.730 --> 00:13:25.430
I won't. For Glen's sake, as well.

00:13:25.430 --> 00:13:26.200
Nenshin!

00:13:26.200 --> 00:13:27.270
Gattai!

00:13:27.270 --> 00:13:30.760
Go! Aquarion!

00:13:44.820 --> 00:13:46.220
Stop it!

00:13:46.220 --> 00:13:48.780
Stop it, both of you!

00:14:06.440 --> 00:14:07.930
Reika!

00:14:10.410 --> 00:14:11.280
Sirius!

00:14:11.280 --> 00:14:13.510
Enough, Sirius!

00:14:13.510 --> 00:14:17.180
Sirius! Snap out of it! Please!

00:14:20.550 --> 00:14:24.890
The enemy, Cherubim Mars, and Solar
Aquarion are nearly equally matched.

00:14:24.890 --> 00:14:26.790
At this rate, they'll...

00:14:26.790 --> 00:14:31.200
Reading a high-energy reaction between the two machines!

00:14:31.200 --> 00:14:33.430
Are you coming, Toma?

00:14:40.510 --> 00:14:42.640
What the hell was that?!

00:14:52.690 --> 00:14:55.760
How I have waited...

00:14:55.760 --> 00:15:01.060
I have waited so long for this moment to come!

00:15:15.940 --> 00:15:18.610
What were you aiming at, scrub?

00:15:22.280 --> 00:15:24.250
What?!

00:15:26.690 --> 00:15:29.210
My aim is true.

00:15:59.020 --> 00:16:00.520
Apollo!

00:16:00.520 --> 00:16:03.060
Dammit! I can't do an emergency release!

00:16:03.060 --> 00:16:05.690
Apollo! Get a hold of yourself!

00:16:10.060 --> 00:16:16.700
Do you remember, Apollonius?
How it was 12,000 years ago?

00:16:21.740 --> 00:16:25.810
Your right hand hunted humans...

00:16:25.810 --> 00:16:29.910
Your left hand held my hand.

00:16:42.030 --> 00:16:47.300
We so loved each other that even the rising sun envied us...

00:16:51.870 --> 00:16:53.970
Apollonius...

00:16:53.970 --> 00:16:56.080
Apollonius?!

00:16:56.080 --> 00:16:58.680
What is this memory?!

00:16:58.680 --> 00:17:04.980
Remember... My love!

00:17:27.980 --> 00:17:30.440
I remember now...

00:17:30.440 --> 00:17:36.710
We so loved each other, we made even the lovely blossoms blush...

00:17:38.090 --> 00:17:39.890
You do?

00:18:02.680 --> 00:18:03.910
Seliane!

00:18:03.910 --> 00:18:05.940
Apollonius!

00:18:08.220 --> 00:18:14.320
Even as a residual memory, you cannot forget Seliane...

00:18:14.320 --> 00:18:18.630
But how aware are you...

00:18:18.630 --> 00:18:21.500
...of Seliane's true form?

00:18:21.500 --> 00:18:22.960
True form?!

00:18:22.960 --> 00:18:24.800
Silvia's?!

00:18:30.540 --> 00:18:31.870
Seliane...

00:18:31.870 --> 00:18:37.780
Unable to bear the gravity of your sin, your soul split in two...

00:18:37.780 --> 00:18:42.650
One part became you, and the other became your blood brother.

00:18:42.650 --> 00:18:43.850
What?

00:18:43.850 --> 00:18:48.020
Your right and his left wingless arms are the proof.

00:18:51.190 --> 00:18:55.860
That's ridiculous!
I'm Seliane?! That can't be!

00:18:55.860 --> 00:18:59.900
I see it in your wings- there is no mistake.

00:18:59.900 --> 00:19:04.340
Seliane's soul split into light and darkness.

00:19:04.340 --> 00:19:07.640
Her cheery and beautiful memories became the younger sister,

00:19:07.640 --> 00:19:09.840
while the frightening, dark memories

00:19:09.840 --> 00:19:12.580
of destroying the world became the older brother.

00:19:12.580 --> 00:19:15.550
How could that be?! Brother!

00:19:15.550 --> 00:19:17.450
Dark memories?!

00:19:17.450 --> 00:19:20.720
It was too frightening to bear...

00:19:20.720 --> 00:19:25.490
So you closed your heart to memories of Seliane...

00:19:25.490 --> 00:19:31.130
This can't be! You mean
I am not Apollonius?

00:19:31.130 --> 00:19:34.900
I'm not Solar Wing?!

00:19:34.900 --> 00:19:36.960
You?

00:19:40.110 --> 00:19:45.810
Solar Wing is the mythical, compound life form I love...

00:19:45.810 --> 00:19:48.180
Aquarion!

00:19:50.680 --> 00:19:51.350
No way!

00:19:51.350 --> 00:19:52.690
Solar Wing is...

00:19:52.690 --> 00:19:55.020
...Aquarion?!

00:19:55.020 --> 00:20:00.630
Apollonius betrayed me and left Atlandia.

00:20:00.630 --> 00:20:08.770
But then he returned, reborn in another body in the land of the wingless ones.

00:20:08.770 --> 00:20:13.310
As Aquarion, the Solar Wing.

00:20:13.310 --> 00:20:20.880
Solar Wing destroyed Atlandia with its frighteningly beautiful light.

00:20:20.880 --> 00:20:25.050
A light of such beauty...

00:20:25.050 --> 00:20:27.520
What?

00:20:27.520 --> 00:20:31.530
Now, you will pay for that sin.

00:20:31.530 --> 00:20:33.990
Apollonius, you betrayed me...

00:20:33.990 --> 00:20:36.660
It must surely be painful to lose Seliane-

00:20:36.660 --> 00:20:39.430
even if she is split in two.

00:20:39.430 --> 00:20:41.240
What?!

00:20:41.240 --> 00:20:44.500
Not my sister! Please don't do it!

00:20:48.140 --> 00:20:50.870
Die, Seliane!

00:20:57.220 --> 00:20:59.410
Seliane!

00:21:10.130 --> 00:21:13.730
Have you forgotten?
I am no longer Seliane!

00:21:13.730 --> 00:21:20.470
I am the heir to Apollonius' wing-
Silvia de Alisia!

00:21:27.350 --> 00:21:29.620
Brother!

00:21:29.620 --> 00:21:32.350
Futile resistance.

00:21:32.350 --> 00:21:34.010
Master Toma!

00:21:35.420 --> 00:21:37.820
Shed tears of sadness!

00:21:37.820 --> 00:21:40.380
Stop it!

00:21:51.270 --> 00:21:52.970
Brother!

00:21:52.970 --> 00:21:55.600
Sirius!

00:23:42.580 --> 00:23:48.320
<i>The Tree of Life blooms with flowers,</i> <i>bearing the fruit of a new world.</i>

00:23:48.320 --> 00:23:52.190
<i>Let me say this in words</i> <i>you can hear with your ears:</i>

00:23:52.190 --> 00:23:57.190
<i>The final episode of</i> Aquarion: <i>"The Day the World Begins"</i>
